<div><strong><em>Copula</em></strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div>Something is something else</div>
    <div>noun + <strong>haiℏ</strong> + noun</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">X係Y</div>
    <div>X haiℏ Y</div>
    <div>X is Y</div>
</div>
<div><strong><em>Relative</em></strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div>Subordinate clause that modifies a noun phrase</div>
    <div>verb-jó + object<em>(referent)</em>-<strong>ge</strong><em>(relative pronoun)</em> + subject<em>(antecedent)</em></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">飲<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">咗</span>牛奶<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">嘅</span>隻貓</div>
    <div>yám jó ngàuℏ náaiℏ ge jēk màau</div>
    <div>The cat that/who drank the milk</div>
</div>
<div><strong><em>Conditional</em></strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div>Subordinate clause that expresses a requirement</div>
    <div><strong>yùℏ gwó</strong> + subject + verb + object + <strong>jauℏ</strong> + subject + verb + object</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">如果</span>隻貓入咗間房，佢<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">就</span>會飲啲牛奶</div>
    <div>yùℏ gwó jēk màau yaℏp jó hàaℏn fòℏng, kéuiℏ jauℏ wuiℏ yám dì ngàuℏ náaiℏ</div>
    <div>If the cat enters the room then he will drink the milk</div>
    <div><strong>yùℏ gwó</strong> + subject + verb + object + <strong>jauℏ</strong> + subject + <strong>mℏ</strong> + verb + object</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">如果</span>隻貓<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">唔</span>入間房，佢<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">就唔</span>會飲啲牛奶</div>
    <div>yùℏ gwó jēk màau mℏ yaℏp hàaℏn fòℏng, kéuiℏ jauℏ mℏ wuiℏ yám dì ngàuℏ náaiℏ</div>
    <div>If the cat does not enter the room then he will not drink the milk</div>
</div>
